1204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 333 0 R
/E (interface to validate that all implemented features worked correctly. These included the creation of student, course, instructor, and enrollment records, along with validation rule checks for mandatory fields, eligibility criteria, and enrollment constraints. Record type behavior was verified for different course categories, while flows were tested to confirm automated enrollment approvals and seat availability checks. Apex trigger functionality was also validated to ensure automatic confirmation and record updates. In addition, screenshots of generated reports and dashboards were documented to confirm accurate data visualization, enrollment tracking, and performance monitoring. All these screenshots serve as evidence of proper system functionality and efficiency during testing.)
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [50]
>>
endobj
